    {
      "id": "afpOEiY-KNFZEktuUp1rw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1589.3884860141736,
      "y": -144.61955613738178,
      "width": 1353.7833251953125,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "kk0R9HXtTc1GZz4MazAdq",
      "index": "b0x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 726771921,
      "version": 1874,
      "versionNonce": 2008555697,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786687321100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "App Features:\n- XP collection tied to levels\n- Daily streak\n- Habits - repeated - tied to streak - the same activity repeated over multiple days\n    - examples: \n- Activity - once-off - a singular task which gains the user XP\n    - examples: \n- Goals - Set by User - from template - categorised (mind, body, social -> all related to mental health sphere)\n    examples: User fills X, Y, Z\n    - Save Xamount of money by Ydate\n    - Walk Xdist a Ytimespan for Ztime\n    - Talk to Xpeople per Ytimespan for Ztime\n    - Meditate Xtime per Ytimespan for Ztime\n- Trophies - Trees - at certain levels the user 'wins'/earns trophies (trophy tied to XP)\n- User can track/see via graph visual how well they have been achieving mind/body/social goals over time \n    - app will suggest specific goals for them based on previous completed/incompleted goals\n        - example: If user had the goal to walk 10km a week for a month, but failed, the app will suggest this goal to the user to try again\n- User can see their historical completed/unforfilled goals\n- If user is underperforming significantly on goal, the app will suggest to scrap that goal for now and aim a bit more reasonably\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "App Features:\n- XP collection tied to levels\n- Daily streak\n- Habits - repeated - tied to streak - the same activity repeated over multiple days\n    - examples: \n- Activity - once-off - a singular task which gains the user XP\n    - examples: \n- Goals - Set by User - from template - categorised (mind, body, social -> all related to mental health sphere)\n    examples: User fills X, Y, Z\n    - Save Xamount of money by Ydate\n    - Walk Xdist a Ytimespan for Ztime\n    - Talk to Xpeople per Ytimespan for Ztime\n    - Meditate Xtime per Ytimespan for Ztime\n- Trophies - Trees - at certain levels the user 'wins'/earns trophies (trophy tied to XP)\n- User can track/see via graph visual how well they have been achieving mind/body/social goals over time \n    - app will suggest specific goals for them based on previous completed/incompleted goals\n        - example: If user had the goal to walk 10km a week for a month, but failed, the app will suggest this goal to the user to try again\n- User can see their historical completed/unforfilled goals\n- If user is underperforming significantly on goal, the app will suggest to scrap that goal for now and aim a bit more reasonably\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
